+two-channel transfer function it cancels **only if ch0 and ch1 share it.** Verify
+whether the two channels sample simultaneously or at a fixed offset, and whether
+that offset is documented. This sits alongside inter-channel filter phase
+matching as something that corrupts H(f) without touching any noise floor.
 
